37
00:01:38.283 --> 00:01:45.353
A lot of, A lot of! Much, Much, Much! Many, Many, Many! A few, A few!

38
00:01:45.653 --> 00:01:52.420
A little, A little! Plenty of, Plenty of! None, None, None! Some, Some, Some!

39
00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:55.315
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:01:56.317 --> 00:02:13.210
Sokha is planning a party. How many guests are coming? A lot of friends! How much food do they need? Plenty of rice and some chicken. They have got a few bottles of water, but only a little ice. Are there any snacks? None! He needs to go shopping.

41
00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.531
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
